  "hero_headline": "AI 开发降速争议蔓延，全球地缘冲突加剧能源通胀 / Global AI Slowdown Debate Rages Amidst Energy Inflation and Geopolitical Tensions",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI 安全与发展速度的博弈，OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的内部预警与行业领导者的降速呼吁引发广泛震动，而 DeepSeek 等新模型的突破依然展示着算力架构的演进潜力。财经领域，受美伊冲突导致能源供给中断影响，全球能源价格攀升，亚洲新兴市场面临严峻的 LNG 成本压力，金融市场在 AI 泡沫担忧与避险情绪中波动。时政方面，霍尔木兹海峡的航运危机与美欧外交政策调整成为焦点，大国在 AI 战略竞争与地缘安全之间寻找新的平衡点，全球宏观环境不确定性持续上升。\n\nToday's tech focus is the tension between AI safety and innovation speed, as internal warnings from OpenAI and Anthropic trigger widespread industry debates, while new releases like DeepSeek's v4.1-Flash demonstrate continued architectural progress. Financially, energy supply disruptions from the US-Iran conflict have fueled price surges, placing immense cost pressure on Asian LNG markets, while global equity markets react to both AI bubble skepticism and geopolitical hedging. Politically, the crisis in the Strait of Hormuz and evolving US-EU policies dominate, as major powers struggle to balance AI strategic competition with geopolitical stability in an increasingly uncertain global landscape.",
